{"id":"edf61bb893ee0ba7","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization.md","title":"极小固定点给出KF规范模型","display":"thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization — 极小固定点给出KF规范模型","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization","aliases":["91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization","91-thm-KF-fp-char","91-thm-KF-model"],"display":"thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization — 极小固定点给出KF规范模型","depends_on":["[[91-df-KF]]","[[91-df-minimal-fixed-point]]","[[91-thm-KF-soundness]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization</span><span>91-thm-KF-fp-char</span><span>91-thm-KF-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization — 极小固定点给出KF规范模型"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a0a2284f96eaea1d\" href=\"?note=a0a2284f96eaea1d\" title=\"91-df-KF\">91-df-KF</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"460308c7099a8386\" href=\"?note=460308c7099a8386\" title=\"91-df-minimal-fixed-point\">91-df-minimal-fixed-point</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cb582ee79087af80\" href=\"?note=cb582ee79087af80\" title=\"91-thm-KF-soundness\">91-thm-KF-soundness</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization-—-极小固定点给出-KF-规范模型\">thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization — 极小固定点给出 KF 规范模型</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_{\\min}\">\\(\\Gamma_{\\min}\\)</span> (规范强 Kleene 跳跃的极小一致固定点)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M_{\\min}=(\\mathbb N,T\\mapsto\\Gamma_{\\min})\">\\(\\mathcal M_{\\min}=(\\mathbb N,T\\mapsto\\Gamma_{\\min})\\)</span> (以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_{\\min}\">\\(\\Gamma_{\\min}\\)</span> 解释 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的经典外层结构)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KF}\">\\(\\mathrm{KF}\\)</span> (标准 KF 公理系统)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}KF\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}characterization}\n\\vdash\n\\mathcal M_{\\min}\\models\\mathrm{KF},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}KF\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}characterization}\n\\vdash\n\\mathcal M_{\\min}\\models\\mathrm{KF},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span>，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n&amp;\\to\n\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in\\Gamma_{\\min},\\\\\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n&amp;\\to\n\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\notin\\Gamma_{\\min}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n&amp;\\to\n\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in\\Gamma_{\\min},\\\\\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n&amp;\\to\n\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\notin\\Gamma_{\\min}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>两行都来自一阶可靠性：在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M_{\\min}\">\\(\\mathcal M_{\\min}\\)</span> 中，\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\">\\(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\)</span> 为真恰当\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in\\Gamma_{\\min}\">\\(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in\\Gamma_{\\min}\\)</span>；其外部经典否定为真恰当\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\notin\\Gamma_{\\min}\">\\(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\notin\\Gamma_{\\min}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>第二行不能加强成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\in\\Gamma_{\\min}\">\\(\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\in\\Gamma_{\\min}\\)</span>：\ngap 情形同样满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\notin\\Gamma_{\\min}\">\\(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\notin\\Gamma_{\\min}\\)</span>。\n反方向也一般失败；极小固定点可包含许多\nKF 未能逐句证明为真的句子。裸 KF 允许其他固定点模型，并不唯一公理化\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_{\\min}\">\\(\\Gamma_{\\min}\\)</span>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization-—-极小固定点给出-KF-规范模型","text":"thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization — 极小固定点给出 KF 规范模型","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-KF","status":"resolved","id":"a0a2284f96eaea1d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-KF]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-minimal-fixed-point","status":"resolved","id":"460308c7099a8386","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-minimal-fixed-point]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-thm-KF-soundness","status":"resolved","id":"cb582ee79087af80","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-KF-soundn